-- title:
--   `ε` can be taken rational (round six, `rat_eps`)
-- statement:
--   **`ε` can be taken rational**: lowering `ε` to a nearby rational keeps `P.Ok` and `κ < gap`
--   (all constraints are monotone or open in `ε ≥ 1/2`).
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6MFinal`):
